{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The read path treats an empty request context differently from a nonempty one: it queues the request, but skips acknowledgments whose context is empty. I’ll probe this with a healthy elected cluster and a nonempty control. The API permits lost requests, so this alone does not establish a liveness defect.\n"}}
